hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27908","Al-Walid ibn Muslim narrated to us, he said: Said ibn Abd al-Aziz informed us, from Makhul, from Umm Ayman, that the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: Do not abandon prayer deliberately, for whoever abandons prayer deliberately, the protection of Allah and His Messenger is free of him."
